    "detailed_description": "&quot;Floating World&quot; is an ocean-themed survival building game where you must find food and resources to build a shelter and survive each day. Tame animals, build houses, craft tools\u2014your creativity and effort will guide you through this ocean world.<br>\ufeff<br>The game features numerous islands, a storyline, and puzzle elements, along with a wealth of building materials and tools. You can experiment with different architectural styles and use various tools to uncover the story of this floating world. \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\ud83d\udd0d\ud83d\udca1<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/24706aa7123b21765e75efe5c8a5f125.poster.avif?t=1717724779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/24706aa7123b21765e75efe5c8a5f125.webm?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>About the game</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build system</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/c64198176f67eee8e6bf7048d26f741d.poster.avif?t=1717724779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/c64198176f67eee8e6bf7048d26f741d.webm?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/c64198176f67eee8e6bf7048d26f741d.mp4?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\ud83c\udfe0\ud83e\ude91 Building System: Expand your activity area on the sea with a building gun. Construct houses, roofs, and eaves to create a comfortable home. Decorate with a variety of furniture.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Navigation system</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/2dfdc7ed5b0c3fdb6d87c0ed85bdcc2a.poster.avif?t=1717724779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/2dfdc7ed5b0c3fdb6d87c0ed85bdcc2a.webm?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/2dfdc7ed5b0c3fdb6d87c0ed85bdcc2a.mp4?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\ud83d\udee5\ufe0f\u2699\ufe0f Navigation System: Build sails for your raft. For faster travel, construct engines and rudders to better control your journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">synth</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/82e18cc75dca910d44c9622d92c9c3de.poster.avif?t=1717724779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/82e18cc75dca910d44c9622d92c9c3de.webm?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/82e18cc75dca910d44c9622d92c9c3de.mp4?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\ud83d\udd27\ud83d\udd29 Synthesizer: Almost everything in the floating world can be crafted with this machine. Resources can also be recycled using it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Backpack system</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/a8e1eae22f19dbd70e227482b4ef27a1.poster.avif?t=1717724779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/a8e1eae22f19dbd70e227482b4ef27a1.webm?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/a8e1eae22f19dbd70e227482b4ef27a1.mp4?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\ud83c\udf92\ud83c\udfae Backpack System: Designed for VR, the backpack system allows you to store items just like in real life. Quickly place items in your backpack or use the quick insert button.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival Farming System</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/45a2ce68cf5f98ed25f530b50067aa11.poster.avif?t=1717724779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/45a2ce68cf5f98ed25f530b50067aa11.webm?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/45a2ce68cf5f98ed25f530b50067aa11.mp4?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\ud83c\udf31\ud83d\udc16 Survival Farming System: Besides basic ocean activities like fishing and grilling fish, you can also build planting pots to grow your own plants and even raise pigs on your raft.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Different game modes</h2>\ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfa8 Different Game Modes: The game offers Easy, Normal, Hard, Peaceful, and Creative modes. Creative mode allows you to freely build your creations without worrying about resource consumption.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/6b8f8cca1b373aa4da15db126b73b08f.poster.avif?t=1717724779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/6b8f8cca1b373aa4da15db126b73b08f.webm?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/6b8f8cca1b373aa4da15db126b73b08f.mp4?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/a7ee51c3742658f5cb23d96b3162ebf1.poster.avif?t=1717724779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/a7ee51c3742658f5cb23d96b3162ebf1.webm?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/a7ee51c3742658f5cb23d96b3162ebf1.mp4?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\ud83d\udd28\ud83d\udd2e Item Upgrade System: In the later stages, build an upgrader, mining machine, and teleporter to enhance your ship and make exploring the world easier.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/22c4222627a9723c574633f53603113d.poster.avif?t=1717724779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/22c4222627a9723c574633f53603113d.webm?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/22c4222627a9723c574633f53603113d.mp4?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/1b725d2dd701f5845651f34af33db945.poster.avif?t=1717724779\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/1b725d2dd701f5845651f34af33db945.webm?t=1717724779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006050/extras/1b725d2dd701f5845651f34af33db945.mp4?t=1717724779\